Subject: [PATCH] AI_AB_TEST Economy: WarBudget flag and
 CvEconomicAI::GetAffordableWarUnits (the army gold can pay for, for War's
 build-up target)

BigArmy's honest cost (11 aggressors): unit upkeep 22 a turn in the window
and 73 at war, against 7 and 25 left after buildings. GetAffordableWarUnits
(iTurns) returns the largest N such that
  gold + iTurns x (net before unit upkeep - today's unit upkeep
                   - extra upkeep of N more units) >= 0,
with the extra upkeep from CP's own formula (CalculateUnitCost). It's
negative when today's units already can't be kept that long, ignores
BigArmy's waiver, and is cached per turn (reset on Reset and Read).

The flag WarBudget (off in the bundle) is for War's side: the build-up's
army target from the normal army up to BigArmy's size, by this answer,
with no waiver. Economy uses the flag nowhere yet. Rebased on claude/ab-c1 0561379 (after ArmyQuality and ArmyScrap) at 2:22pm ET; written 2:21pm ET.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
